26:T457,<span style="color:#a78bfa;font-weight:600"># Project Setup</span>
- Run <span style="color:#c4b5fd">`pnpm dev`</span> to start (not npm)
- Run <span style="color:#c4b5fd">`pnpm test:unit src/auth`</span> to test a single module
- Build: <span style="color:#c4b5fd">`pnpm build`</span> — always typecheck after changes

<span style="color:#a78bfa;font-weight:600"># Code Style</span>
- Use ES modules (import/export), never CommonJS require()
- Destructure imports: import { foo } from 'bar'
- 2-space indentation, single quotes, no semicolons

<span style="color:#a78bfa;font-weight:600"># Architecture</span>
- API handlers live in src/api/handlers/
- Database queries go through src/db/queries/ only
- Use the Result<T,E> pattern for error handling, never throw

<span style="color:#a78bfa;font-weight:600"># Git</span>
- Branch naming: feat/, fix/, chore/ prefixes
- Squash commits before merging to main
- PR description must include test plan

<span style="color:#a78bfa;font-weight:600"># Important</span>
- NEVER commit .env files
- Run <span style="color:#c4b5fd">`pnpm lint`</span> before committing18:["$","$L13",null,{"delay":100,"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Example CLAUDE.md"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"code-block my-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"code-block-header","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs font-mono","style":{"color":"#64748b"},"children":"CLAUDE.md"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded","style":{"background":"rgba(124,58,237,0.12)","color":"#a78bfa","fontFamily":"monospace"},"children":"markdown"}]]}],["$","$L25",null,{"text":"# Project Setup\n- Run `pnpm dev` to start (not npm)\n- Run `pnpm test:unit src/auth` to test a single module\n- Build: `pnpm build` — always typecheck after changes\n\n# Code Style\n- Use ES modules (import/export), never CommonJS require()\n- Destructure imports: import { foo } from 'bar'\n- 2-space indentation, single quotes, no semicolons\n\n# Architecture\n- API handlers live in src/api/handlers/\n- Database queries go through src/db/queries/ only\n- Use the Result<T,E> pattern for error handling, never throw\n\n# Git\n- Branch naming: feat/, fix/, chore/ prefixes\n- Squash commits before merging to main\n- PR description must include test plan\n\n# Important\n- NEVER commit .env files\n- Run `pnpm lint` before committing"}]]}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"overflow-x-auto","style":{"padding":"16px","margin":0,"fontFamily":"var(--font-mono, 'JetBrains Mono', monospace)","fontSize":"0.85rem","lineHeight":"1.65","color":"#c9d1d9","background":"var(--code-bg)"},"children":["$","code",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$26"}}]}]]}]]}]
